        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-3/4\" Diameter Classic Shower Door Knob Pair</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese beautiful 1-3/4\" diameter classic style glass shower door knobs are easy to grab and compliment the traditional designed bathroom.  Their solid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-CLASSIC2-size.gif?v=1704354684\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Classic Shower Door Knob Pair Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Single <a href=\"/products/large-classic-shower-door-knob-sd-classic1\"><b>Classic Shower Door Knob</b></a> and matching <a href=\"/products/classic-cabinet-knob\"><b>Classic Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Classic Shower Door Knobs\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 classic knobs and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (knobs hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Knobs - 1 knob for each side of the glass)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Shower Door Knob Pair",
                "description": "These beautiful 1-3/4 inch diameter classic style glass shower door knobs are easy to grab and compliment the traditional designed bathroom.  Their solid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use. Available in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.",
                "keywords": "DWD-SD-CLASSIC2 Classic Shower Door Knobs, traditional shower door knobs,  bath room shower knobs, shower handles, 1-3/4 inch large shown knobs, traditional designed bathroom shower door knobs,"
